l one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1), and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"qskF5Gm5pMV0","name":"Point-Blank Surge","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When this model shoots at enemies within 12\", unmodified results of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules).","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"5Wpo74lRNhqB","name":"Counter-Attack","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Strikes first when charged.","hasRating":null,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"eyMkgYDVrP7C","name":"Takedown Strike","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Once per game, when it's this model's turn to attack in melee, it may make one attack at Quality 2+ with AP(2), Deadly(3), and Takedown.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"wsqfB0fq69eG","name":"Shielded","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Units where all models have this rule get +1 to defense rolls against hits that are not from spells.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"27DHOeVHMwrj","name":"Slayer","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When this model shoots at enemies over 9\" away, or when it charges, its weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"O_sf2rsHA7rD","name":"Evasive","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Enemies get -1 to hit rolls when attacking units where all models have this rule.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"Y3OebIlS-KTf","name":"Shred when Shooting","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets Shred when shooting.","hasRating":false,"coreType":5,"targetType":1},{"id":"1qiGNqpxKb24","name":"Disintegrate","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Ignores Regeneration, and against units where most models have Defense 2+ to Defense 3+, this weapon gets AP(+2).","hasRating":false,"coreType":n